      "text": "Lehi1 chastened because of murmuring against the Lord, 1 Ne. 16:25. voice of the Lord chastened Laman1 and Lemuel, 1 Ne. 16:39. chastisement of our peace was upon the Messiah, Mosiah 14:5 (Isa. 53:5). the Lord sees fit to chasten his people, Mosiah 23:21. except the Lord chastens his people, they will not remember him, Hel. 12:3. the Lord has chastened Nephites because he loves them, Hel. 15:3. brother of Jared2 is chastened because he remembered not to call upon the Lord, Ether 2:14.",
